descriptions.description:
With enough energy, press  after the fourth/fifth segment of Basic Attack: Cloud Piercer, Dash Attack: Hiten no Tsuru - Slash, or Ultimate to activate:
Continuously fires enhanced arrows forward, dealing massive Electric DMG;
When the first enhanced arrow hits an enemy or the ground, 6 Electro Quivers are generated. When the last enhanced arrow hits an enemy, it activates Electro Quivers on the field, firing Ha-Oto no Ya at the target hit, dealing Electric DMG;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Edge Revealed is active, automatically triggers after Ultimate: Zanshin:
Unleashes a large area Pierce attack on enemies ahead, dealing massive Electric DMG and consuming Edge Revealed;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.
